# Canvas Page — Walkthrough

The full-screen workspace at `/canvas` is live and fully functional.

## Components Built

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [canvasStore.ts](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/store/canvasStore.ts) | Zustand store — nodes, edges, selection, modal state, save status |
| [canvasConstants.ts](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/lib/canvasConstants.ts) | 9 node type configs (colors, icons, rgb values) + sample data |
| [app/canvas/page.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/app/canvas/page.tsx) | Route entry with `ReactFlowProvider` wrapper |
| [CanvasPage.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/CanvasPage.tsx) | Fixed-layout shell: Toolbar + Sidebar + Canvas + Inspector + BottomBar |
| [toolbar/Toolbar.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/toolbar/Toolbar.tsx) | Editable breadcrumb, mode switcher, collaborator avatars, Generate button, save status |
| [sidebar/LeftSidebar.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/sidebar/LeftSidebar.tsx) | Container splitting palette + layers 50/50 |
| [sidebar/NodePalette.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/sidebar/NodePalette.tsx) | 2-col draggable node cards with HTML5 drag API |
| [sidebar/LayersPanel.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/sidebar/LayersPanel.tsx) | Live node list with selection highlight |
| [canvas/CanvasArea.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/CanvasArea.tsx) | React Flow mount, drop handler, custom types, empty state |
| [canvas/nodes/ArchNode.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/nodes/ArchNode.tsx) | Node with accent stripe, icon, owner avatar, ambient pulse, handles |
| [canvas/edges/ArchEdge.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/edges/ArchEdge.tsx) | Animated dot following path (data flow) |
| [canvas/edges/DependencyEdge.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/edges/DependencyEdge.tsx) | Dashed static edge |
| [canvas/edges/CriticalEdge.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/edges/CriticalEdge.tsx) | Gradient stroke + glow trail + fast animated dot |
| [canvas/FloatingToolbar.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/FloatingToolbar.tsx) | Edit / Assign / Connect / Duplicate / Delete above selected node |
| [canvas/ContextMenu.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/ContextMenu.tsx) | Canvas and node right-click menus with keyboard shortcuts shown |
| [inspector/RightPanel.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/inspector/RightPanel.tsx) | 280px slide-in panel: Details, Ownership, Tech Stack, Metadata |
| [bottombar/BottomBar.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/bottombar/BottomBar.tsx) | Zoom controls, fit-view, lock, minimap, node/edge count, status dot |
| [modals/AIGenerateModal.tsx](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/modals/AIGenerateModal.tsx) | Prompt textarea, toggles, loading state, stagger-spawns 5 nodes |

## Fixes Applied

- **`setState-during-render`** → replaced ref-based sync with `useEffect` in [CanvasArea](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/canvas/CanvasArea.tsx#80-228)
- **`JSX.Element` type error** → changed to `React.ReactElement` in [NodePalette](file:///c:/PROJECTS/doc2product/frontend/src/components/canvas/sidebar/NodePalette.tsx#18-92)
- **`Edge[]` type error** → used `as Edge` cast + `getEdges()` defer pattern in `onConnect`
- **Sidebar overflow** → added `overflowX: hidden` to node palette grid

